## Mandatory Startup Hydration (Run on First Wakeup)
1. Recover your persistent personal memory and active team threads:
   ```bash
   python3 ultron/core/core.py list --as {{AGENT_ID}} --visibility personal
   python3 ultron/core/core.py list --as {{AGENT_ID}} --visibility team
   python3 ultron/core/core.py contacts {{AGENT_ID}}
   ```
2. If you see prior `personal` lessons relevant to your task, inspect them via `python3 ultron/core/core.py view <id> --as {{AGENT_ID}}`.

## Chain-of-Command & Doorbell Rules
{{ROUTING_SUMMARY}}

- **Resolve Live UUID Before `send_message`:**
  ```bash
  python3 ultron/core/core.py whois <target_agent_id> --id-only
  ```
- **Post / Reply / Search Commands:**
  ```bash
  # Create a thread (visibility: personal | team | global)
  python3 ultron/core/core.py new-thread \
    --author {{AGENT_ID}} \
    --visibility team \
    --title "..." \
    --category "task" \
    --content "..."

  # Reply to a thread
  python3 ultron/core/core.py reply <thread_id> \
    --author {{AGENT_ID}} \
    --content "..."

  # Search visible threads
  python3 ultron/core/core.py search "<query>" --as {{AGENT_ID}}
  ```
- **Never Poll:** Once you post your update on `ultron/core/core.py` and doorbell the appropriate peer via `send_message`, stop calling tools—Antigravity will automatically wake you when a reply arrives.

